{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"590","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v6072","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"娘太丸","creatorId":"vndb:s1439","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:7","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1439","name":"娘太丸","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:15758","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"橘あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s2214","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:890","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2214","name":"橘あかり","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:19207","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[],"music":[{"creditedName":"YET11","creatorId":"vndb:s785","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s785","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s785","name":"吉沢 務","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:61861","source":"vndb"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c26649","characterName":"天沢 郁未","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"27600","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1122"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5886"],"vndbCharacterId":"c26649"},"originalCharacterName":"天沢 郁未","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"113"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main protagonist of the story, Amasawa Ikumi joined FARGO in the hope of finding out clues about her mother's death, who was a member of the organization. A young girl with a strong will, she became friends with Haruka and Yui at Day 1 and helped them achieve their goals while reaching her own. She was assigned to Class A along with Youko and shares her room with the Shounen."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It was revealed during the Elpod scenes that she was a perverted woman who constantly seeks comfort from the opposite sex, which stemmed from periods of loneliness she suffered during the time her mother was gone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ultimately, she blames FARGO for the death of her mother and embarked on a bloody quest for revenge with the Shounen."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c26649"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物語の主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母の死の理由を知るべく宗団の隔離施設に単身乗り込む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし真実を求める日々は、同時に過去の痛みと凄惨な現実に直面し続ける、試練の旅でもあった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その試練の先には何が待っているのか……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5886","sourceWorkId":"21520","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公。为了给离奇死亡的母亲复仇潜入了母亲曾经生活过的FARGO的隔离设施。A栋，编号为A-12。性格认真、强势。运动神经拔群，是田径部的王牌。小学的时候父亲死亡，母亲失踪后维持生计方式不明。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"27600"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6ebc738df146ed7442afdd5a16ccc27b8c60873d795d2dd8dce6b345a3300f9f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbe0378e263c26440f2f30b92ccb9b2463a09e58ddea6e444b04594bbee2fb1c.webp","width":189,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c110591","characterName":"すず","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c110591"},"originalCharacterName":"すず","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"41"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The titular heroine of this work. While standing in the rain without an umbrella, she meets the protagonist, and by chance, they end up living together for a while. Her speech and behavior are completely different from her appearance, and she is like a young child. The protagonist gradually becomes attracted to her pure-heartedness. But what fate awaited the two of them?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110591"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7eb3ea56ca80c72a67d3d076b66983dddce0bb8541b3fc06da05ab16ee71c19.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9dfa6f4493b2b4e91e446ea0ae65a08876657aa7eb498f9f1f80c18036428937.webp","width":246,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141106","characterName":"月城蛍","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141106"},"originalCharacterName":"月城蛍","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"91"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's classmate from junior high and high school. She’s spent her entire life in this town until she graduated from high school. This summer vacation, she’s returned to the city for the first time in three years and is attending university there. The conversation was a little awkward at first, but as she recalled it, she was reunited with the protagonist. She was truly happy to be reunited with the protagonist. ...There was just one thing she couldn't express in the back of her mind."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141106"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f3d1beb018b3bbb853efb05659b8c8de7635eeb0ef46640d0b94382da6efa15.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61dea996b4feaef0f6913826258a1b32f2b6671a6d93b3fcb7f7ea93ca376589.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141112","characterName":"新条七海","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141112"},"originalCharacterName":"新条七海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"71"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"AA"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"37"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who attends a local girls' high school. She met the protagonist when she first enrolled, and their relationship has continued ever since. She loves swimming more than anything and is the captain of the swimming club at school. Her powerful swimming is unimaginable given her small physique, and she is said to be one of the best in the country. There are also rumors that she is attracting attention from all quarters as an Olympic athlete... but she doesn't seem to care much about it, saying it's just a rumor."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141112"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/85f47000d39d8388186eea13098a313c28ce0be99456bd391e8bdad533f79158.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5df0c678b482f2b8fa454696a31295b2901e20acd219da033479762f13b38c8f.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141113","characterName":"千夜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141113"},"originalCharacterName":"千夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Relative Of Sakuma, she is often seen sporting a pika*hu hat and ends up meeting the protagonist one lucky day."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141113"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b6f18aba24ffa6a606f9a116019cc413578376f603c37ea98bfe12b272764e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77d854baaadf155b7bdc7e887e405170579f74c26b1e0416882d6d2081f4131e.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141114","characterName":"ミツキ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141114"},"originalCharacterName":"ミツキ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A student at an all girls highschool. She can be timid, but is very kind and caring of the protagonist as well as her older brother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141114"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f1eb27564209e9c78d8dc332c2e52304768c10fbb2e7d1e2c542c6cd1ba5b88.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/80217637b0f1c7923a64695caa6d29182efbac37e686e98cbd8e679f9329b405.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141115","characterName":"新条紫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141115"},"originalCharacterName":"新条紫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nanami Shinjo’s older sister. She is a doctor at the hospital where the protagonist's father works, and has known the protagonist for a long time. Her petite sister is roughly the same size as a weasel, and when they walk together, they are often mistaken for mother and daughter.Her specialty is psychosomatic medicine, but her bold and unique treatment methods that are not bound by preconceived notions and the impact she has had is well-known among doctors, and despite her young age, she is known as an all-round doctor."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141115"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/89/89bc1f02d63e4e9e517a265fe39db22c65816ecf46c29db86983a16fdc952ad3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b40611ee113a72a55d8478f0fb378773f37dab0d29394e521367d23cb72453f.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]